.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH teamtype-client 1  "client 0.9.2 (e05a26724 2026-07-08)" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
teamtype\-client \- Open a JSON\-RPC connection to the Teamtype daemon on stdin/stdout. Used by text editor plugins
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBteamtype client\fR [\fB\-\-directory\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Open a JSON\-RPC connection to the Teamtype daemon on stdin/stdout. Used by text editor plugins
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-directory\fR \fI<DIRECTORY>\fR
The shared directory. Defaults to current directory
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v0.9.2 (e05a26724 2026\-07\-08)
